.TH SCHED_SETSCHEDULER 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sched_setscheduler \- sets scheduling policy and parameters; elevated policies can require privileges
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sched.h>
.B int sched_setscheduler(pid_t process, int policy, const struct sched_param* parameter);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sets scheduling policy and parameters; elevated policies can require privileges.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sched_setscheduler (2)
